+    ) -> None:
+        """Copy page-first rows through CUDA memcpy instead of a custom kernel.
+
+        WSL/CUDA can report an illegal address when the page-first AOT kernels
+        access a pinned host destination or restore rows from a pinned host
+        source. A one-row ``copy_`` keeps the tensor row bounded and uses
+        PyTorch's normal device transfer path. This is a cold-path fallback
+        selected explicitly by an environment flag.
